; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Core.c	   199     \ACCEPT TX
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Core.c	   200     \REASON The condition is hardware dependent always true. The unnecessary code parts should be
